  "details": "## Description\n\nUser-uploaded transparent stickers/emoji repeat edge UVs. This occurs on the Unity 6 branch, but not on the main branch. Images are correct in the expression menu\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nPlace a user-uploaded transparent sticker into the world. The sticker has the edge UVs repeat over the span of the plane.\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-07-26_10-40-18.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_39972ef6-5ee1-48bf-ad2a-410c40e650d1/1/file)",
